cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Programming Language Lineage Dataset"
version: "5.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Muchhala
    given-names: Sanket
url: "https://www.languagelineage.org/dataset"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sanketmuchhala/LanguageLineage"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A cited graph of what programming languages and their compilers, runtimes and
  engines are written in, how they bootstrapped, and which languages influenced
  which. Every relationship carries an evidence URL and a confidence score. The
  data is licensed CC BY 4.0; the site and generator code are MIT.
keywords:
  - programming languages
  - compilers
  - bootstrapping
  - knowledge graph
  - history of computing
